[ar:Low Tide Club]
[al:Tidal Signal]
[ti:Quiet Current]
[00:01.25]Beneath the noise, a quiet current.
[00:05.75]A pulse we carry through the blue.
[00:10.25]The city folds into the water.
[00:14.75]The tide brings every colour through.
[00:19.25]Hold this moment in the low light.
[00:23.75]Let the rhythm find its room.
[00:28.25]We leave a signal in the silence.
[00:32.75]And follow where the colours bloom.
